    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "The commutator length cl(g) of g ∈ [G, G] is the least number of com-\nmutators in G whose product is g, and the stable commutator length is scl(g) :=\nlimn→∞ cl(g n )/n.\n    Conjecture: Let G be a hyperbolic group. Then the stable commutator length\ntakes on rational values on [G, G].                                 D. Calegari",
